lopment", "energy"], "long_description": "Real Learning in a Virtual World: Taking learning to the next level through the World Bank Group (WBG) - Open Learning Campus (OLC)  VR app. \n \nWBG-OLC's immersive learning powers storytelling through bite-sized 360 stories, virtual tours, and visualizations and takes you inside the world of some of the most crucial challanges of global development. \n \nExperience next-generation interactive learning by getting a peek into the most pressing challenges - climate change, education, gender, urban development, international trade, public health, and more. Also available are on-demand resources, expert talks, data visualization, and other online courses through the Open Learning Campus (OLC) Platform.\n \nWhether you are a policymaker, development practitioner, or are curious to learn more, the WBG-OLC VR app is a place to virtually experience real-world challenges.", "short_description": "WBG-OLC's immersive learning powers storytelling through bite-sized 360 stories, virtual tours, and visualizations and takes you inside the world of some of the most crucial challenges of global development.\n\nExperience next-generation interactive learning by getting a peek into the most pressing challenges - climate change, education, gender, urban development, international trade, public health, and more."}]}, "developer_name": "Visyon360", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.worldbank.org/en/about/legal/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "World Bank Group VR", "support_website_url": "https://olc.worldbank.org/", "website_url": "https://olc.worldbank.org/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["EDUCATIONAL", "MEDIA_PLAYER"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null